.TH u8_len 3 "Version 1.0" "December 2023" "lib/utf8"
.SH NAME
u8_len \- Calculate the length of a UTF-8 character
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <lib/utf8.h>
.sp
.BI "size_t u8_len(const char* u8, size_t count)"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The function .BR u8_len () calculates the length of a UTF-8 character. The function takes the following parameters:
.sp
1. The input UTF-8 character to be processed.
2. The number of bytes in the input UTF-8 character.
.sp
The function returns the number of bytes in the UTF-8 character.
.SH RETURN VALUE
The function returns the number of bytes in the UTF-8 character.
.SH EXAMPLES
No examples are provided for this function.
.SH SEE ALSO
.B u8_to_wc
